Martin,

I have included the .stan script for one of the bandit models in the package (bandit4arm_4par) and a modified version for 3 choices (bandit3arm_4par). I made some comments in the code (3-armed version) where I made changes. As you can see, very little needs changed—I hope this can help!

Let me know if you have any questions.

Best,

Nate
From: hbayesd...@googlegroups.com <hbayesd...@googlegroups.com> on behalf of Woo-Young Ahn <wooyou...@gmail.com>
Sent: Monday, January 29, 2018 6:02:13 PM
To: hbayesdm-users
Subject: Re: 3 Arm Bandit

Dear Martin,

Yes, although I need to hear the details of the tasks, typically it's fairly straightforward to model 3-arm bandit tasks. If there is a particular task you have in mind or data you want to model and need to discuss it, please feel free to send an email.

Best,
Young

